        "text": "Jack Beeton (born 17 November 2007) is an Australian racing driver who currently competes in Indy NXT with HMD Motorsports.\n\nBorn in Manly, Sydney, and raised on the Gold Coast, Beeton was the 2023 Formula 4 South East Asia Champion and the 2024 Italian F4 vice-champion. He then moved up to Formula Regional Europe for 2025 with Prema.",
